    - target: {fileID: 8202928473594746054, guid: d4b1b937ea86eec4390515a46ba044fe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: "<align=center><b>Instructions</b></align>\r\n\u2022 Navigate through
        the <b>network</b> by moving from one <i>node</i> to another.  \r\n\u2022
        Avoid <color=red>red zones</color>, as they represent dangerous or compromised
        areas.  \r\n\u2022 Your goal is to reach the <color=green>green zone</color>
        safely.  \r\n\u2022 Plan your route carefully \u2014 a wrong move could block
        your progress.  \r\n\u2022 Reach the target zone to <b>complete the challenge</b>."
